  "description": "Logs application events into a SQL database\n      -----------------------------------------------------------------------\n      Create this table in your SQL database:\n\n      CREATE TABLE Logs (\n      Id INT IDENTITY(1,1) PRIMARY KEY,\n      Timestamp DATETIME,\n      LogLevel NVARCHAR(50),\n      Category NVARCHAR(100),\n      Message NVARCHAR(MAX),\n      Exception NVARCHAR(MAX)\n      );\n\n      Use It in a .NET App\n\n      using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;\n      using SqlLogger;\n      \n      in Program.cs\n      var loggerFactory = LoggerFactory.Create(builder =>\n      {\n      builder.AddSqlLogger(\"Server=.;Database=MyLogsDb;Trusted_Connection=True;\");\n      });",
